{"seq":3,"slug":"coverage-gap-cannibalization-field","title":"覆盖盲区、柜点互食与现场验证：勘址、租约谈判与落地可行性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/parcel-locker-network-site-planning-optimization/site-selection-coverage-optimization/coverage-gap-cannibalization-field","wordCount":2987,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"覆盖盲区-柜点互食与现场验证-勘址-租约谈判与落地可行性\">覆盖盲区、柜点互食与现场验证：勘址、租约谈判与落地可行性</h1><p>上一节把选址写成整数规划，得到一张&quot;理论上该建在哪&quot;的地图；这一节处理地图落到地面时会遇到的三件事：哪些地方是优化模型看不见的<strong>真实盲区</strong>，新柜点会抢走多少<strong>老柜点的量</strong>（互食，cannibalization），以及一个已经算好的点位在现场走一圈、谈完租约之后<strong>还剩多少可行性</strong>。德国 2025 年已有超过 15,500 个 Packstation、宣称 90% 居民在十分钟内可达（Wikipedia, Parcel locker, 引 Deutsche Post 数据）；波兰 2025 年终端数近 54,000、按人均密度全球第一。在这种密度下，任何新点几乎必然落在某个已有点的服务圈里，模型给出的&quot;增量覆盖&quot;和现场看到的&quot;真实增量&quot;差距，往往就是互食与物理约束吃掉的部分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>要区分三个容易混为一谈的量：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>名义覆盖（nominal coverage）</strong>：模型按半径或路网距离算出的、落在服务圈内的需求单元比例。它是上界，不是承诺。</li>\n<li><strong>有效覆盖（effective coverage）</strong>：扣除物理不可达（隔高速、无过街、坡度大）、竞品柜点分流、以及用户主观不愿走后剩下的部分。有效覆盖才是选址真正的分子。</li>\n<li><strong>覆盖盲区（coverage gap）</strong>：某个需求单元到<strong>任何</strong>已有点的有效步行成本都超过可接受阈值，或虽在半径内但被物理屏障切断。它是对&quot;没有柜&quot;和&quot;有柜等于没有&quot;的并集。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>互食则是同一件事的反面：新点把某需求单元从&quot;由老点服务&quot;变成&quot;由新点服务&quot;，总量没涨、成本涨了。衡量它的核心指标是<strong>互食率</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>CR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mtext>old</mtext><mtext>before</mtext></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mtext>old</mtext><mtext>after</mtext></msubsup></mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CR} = \\frac{Q_{\\text{old}}^{\\text{before}} - Q_{\\text{old}}^{\\text{after}}}{Q_{\\text{new}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4065em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5261em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4169em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">old</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">before</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4169em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">old</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">after</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即新点带来的订单里，有多大比例是从本网络其他柜点转移来的（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\text{new}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为新点吞吐）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>CR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CR}=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 表示纯转移、零净增；健康扩张一般希望新增点的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>CR</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CR}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CR</span></span></span></span></span></span> 控制在 0.3 以下，而存量优化（挪柜、加密）则主动接受更高的 CR，因为它图的是总成本下降而非总量。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[候选点 j 的模型评分] --&gt; B{现场可达性检查}&#10;    B --&gt;|有物理屏障 无过街| C[标为覆盖盲区 假阳性]&#10;    B --&gt;|可达| D{服务圈与已有点重叠?}&#10;    D --&gt;|无重叠| E[净新增覆盖]&#10;    D --&gt;|重叠| F[用距离衰减估互食率 CR]&#10;    F --&gt;|CR &lt; 0.3| G[进入租约谈判]&#10;    F --&gt;|CR 高 且 无净增| H[降级为存量优化候选]&#10;    C --&gt; I[回到需求侧 核对是否真有需求]&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    H --&gt; J[评估挪点而非加点]\">graph TD\n    A[候选点 j 的模型评分] --&gt; B{现场可达性检查}\n    B --&gt;|有物理屏障 无过街| C[标为覆盖盲区 假阳性]\n    B --&gt;|可达| D{服务圈与已有点重叠?}\n    D --&gt;|无重叠| E[净新增覆盖]\n    D --&gt;|重叠| F[用距离衰减估互食率 CR]\n    F --&gt;|CR &lt; 0.3| G[进入租约谈判]\n    F --&gt;|CR 高 且 无净增| H[降级为存量优化候选]\n    C --&gt; I[回到需求侧 核对是否真有需求]\n    E --&gt; G\n    H --&gt; J[评估挪点而非加点]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>名义覆盖视角</th>\n<th>有效覆盖视角</th>\n<th>现场证据来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>步行可达</td>\n<td>直线 ≤300–400m</td>\n<td>路网步行 ≤3–5 分钟且无需过街天桥</td>\n<td>实地步行计时、路网数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需求归属</td>\n<td>落圈即算被覆盖</td>\n<td>扣掉竞品分流与不愿走</td>\n<td>竞品柜点清点、问卷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新点价值</td>\n<td>增量覆盖面积</td>\n<td>扣除互食后的净增量</td>\n<td>老点取件量前后对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>点位可行性</td>\n<td>用地属性允许</td>\n<td>电源/网络/无障碍/业主同意齐备</td>\n<td>勘址清单 + 租约条款</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"覆盖盲区的识别-模型看不见的三种地方\">覆盖盲区的识别：模型看不见的三种地方</h2><p>第一类是<strong>几何盲区</strong>：需求点密度低且分散，模型为了保覆盖率被迫摊薄，落点选的&quot;中心点&quot;其实谁也不近。这类盲区在卫星城、产业园区、新城边缘最常见。识别办法不是看半径，而是算每个需求单元到最近有效柜点的<strong>最坏步行分位数</strong>——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>95</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{95}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">95</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（95% 分位步行距离），而非平均值；平均值会被市中心的大量近距离用户拉低，掩盖边缘的糟糕体验。上节的 p-center 模型正是为此设计，可参见 <a href=\"coverage-set-covering-model\">覆盖集与最大覆盖选址模型</a>。</p>\n<p>第二类是<strong>屏障盲区</strong>：需求点直线距离很近，但被河流、铁路、封闭式高速匝道或单一过街点切断。跨河小区是最典型的例子：直线 250m，实际绕行 1.2km，路网距离比欧氏距离高 30%–60%。模型若用欧氏距离构矩阵，会把这类点误判为已覆盖。修正办法是用<strong>路网距离矩阵</strong>（OSRM / 高德 / Google 路网 API 生成的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow><mtext>road</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d^{\\text{road}}_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2439em;vertical-align:-0.3948em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">road</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3948em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）替换直线距离，并对无过街天桥的点强制标为不可达。</p>\n<p>第三类是<strong>属性盲区</strong>：模型只看到&quot;有多少户&quot;，看不到&quot;这些人会不会用柜&quot;。低密度别墅区、老年社区、单位宿舍（快递统一代收）对自提柜的接受度低。有调查显示，在高度依赖柜点的城市用户中不满比例可达 83.7%（Wikipedia, Parcel locker, 引中国调查），这类信号说明&quot;有需求&quot;不等于&quot;有柜点需求&quot;。识别属性盲区靠需求侧的转化率而非人口——具体做法见 <a href=\"../locker-network-demand-model/parcel-demand-forecast-features\">包裹需求的预测特征</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"柜点互食的度量与容忍阈值\">柜点互食的度量与容忍阈值</h2><p>互食不是错误，是密度提升的必然结果。关键是把&quot;可接受的互食&quot;和&quot;纯内耗&quot;分开。三种典型重叠要给不同结论：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>串联重叠（同一条通勤路径上的两点）</strong>：用户本会路过，新点只是让顺路更近。互食率高但总体验提升，值得做。</li>\n<li><strong>背靠背重叠（两点服务圈几乎完全重合）</strong>：几乎纯转移，通常是把老点挪到更好位置而不是加点。</li>\n<li><strong>层级重叠（小柜点被大柜点覆盖）</strong>：大柜点容量足、品类全，用户会自愿放弃小点。可接受，但要监控小点是否降到盈亏线以下。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>量化互食的行业做法是把<strong>距离衰减</strong>（distance decay）写进分流模型。常用形式是 Huff 型概率分流：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{ij} = \\frac{A_j \\, e^{-\\beta d_{ij}}}{\\sum_{k} A_k \\, e^{-\\beta d_{ik}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5118em;vertical-align:-0.9857em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5261em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7751em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">ik</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9857em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是柜点吸引力（格口数、可用率、是否 24 小时、是否在同一栋楼），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是步行时间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 是衰减系数。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 越大表示用户越&quot;懒&quot;——步行时间一涨就迅速选更近的点。工程上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 要靠本地历史数据拟合，不能照搬别的城市；国内步行场景的常见拟合值使&quot;多走 200m 等于吸引力下降约 30%–50%&quot;。</p>\n<p>实操层面有一个便宜得多的验证法：<strong>上线前后对比（before/after）</strong>。新点上线 4–8 周后，把服务圈内老点的日均取件量做同期对比，差值即转移量。注意控制变量——季节与电商大促会淹没信号，窗口要么避开大促，要么用同比（YoY）而非环比。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>互食判定</th>\n<th>CR 区间</th>\n<th>处理动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>健康扩张</td>\n<td>&lt; 0.3</td>\n<td>正常推进，纳入网络</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边际可接受</td>\n<td>0.3–0.6</td>\n<td>复核容量与租金，压降成本后再定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纯内耗</td>\n<td>&gt; 0.6 且净增 &lt; 10%</td>\n<td>停止加点，转为挪点或扩容老点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层级替代</td>\n<td>视容量</td>\n<td>保留，但设低利用率淘汰线</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"勘址清单-把-位置好-变成可核验的事实\">勘址清单：把&quot;位置好&quot;变成可核验的事实</h2><p>一个候选点位在签任何东西之前，必须过一份可打勾的勘址清单。缺少任何一项都可能让点位在装完柜后无法投运。清单按&quot;硬约束 → 软约束&quot;排序：</p>\n<p><strong>硬约束（不满足即否决）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>电源</strong>：柜体及冷藏/大屏选件需要市电接入，通常要求独立回路与容量余量；现场确认配电箱位置、可增容与否、布线路径长度与施工许可。无市电而只靠太阳能/电池的户外点位只适合极小柜型。</li>\n<li><strong>网络</strong>：需要稳定回传（4G/5G 或宽带）。地下车库、密闭大堂信号弱，必须实测信号强度而非看运营商覆盖图。</li>\n<li><strong>用地与消防</strong>：柜体落位是否占消防通道、是否满足本地对构筑物退线/占道的要求；占用人行道/公共空间需要城管或市政审批。</li>\n<li><strong>无障碍</strong>：操作面与取件口高度须落进轮椅可达范围（各国标准以约 380–1200mm 的可及区间为基准，美国 2010 ADA Standards 对 storage 类设施规定操作部件与取件口可达性），前方需留出回转空间。这一项常被忽略，装完才发现不合规要返工。详见 <a href=\"../capacity-configuration-network/locker-capacity-dimensioning-model\">容量配置与网络扩张</a> 中对柜型选型的约束。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>软约束（影响收益，可谈判）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>人流与业态</strong>：超市、加油站、便利店、地铁站、大学校园、写字楼大堂是行业公认的高价值落位；InPost 一类运营商的公开表述是&quot;布在人工作、购物、娱乐的城市区域&quot;（Wikipedia, Parcel locker）。判断标准是&quot;顺路率&quot;：用户是否本来就会经过。</li>\n<li><strong>业主意愿与分成模式</strong>：行业里有两种主流合作——<strong>固定租金</strong>（按月/按年付场租）与<strong>收入分成</strong>（按包裹数或收入抽成）。亚马逊对宿主零售商发放 stipend（补贴）是分成模式的代表；7-Eleven、Spar、Co-op Food、Morrisons、Whole Foods 均与其有合作（Wikipedia, Parcel locker）。分成模式降低前期现金压力，但业主会在量起来后要求重谈，租约里要写清调整机制。</li>\n<li><strong>竞品与自家网络距离</strong>：现场清点 300–500m 内所有竞品柜点与自家柜点，作为互食与分流模型的输入。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"租约谈判与落地可行性\">租约谈判与落地可行性</h2><p>租约谈判的目标不是&quot;租金最低&quot;，而是&quot;总拥有成本（TCO）与退出灵活性的平衡&quot;。核心条款：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>期限与退出</strong>：柜点网络要能随需求迁移，租约应尽量短（1–3 年）或带<strong>中期退出条款</strong>（如 12 个月后可按约定通知退出）。长约锁定低租金但杀死网络灵活性，在需求快速变化的区域尤其危险。</li>\n<li><strong>排他性（exclusivity）</strong>：争取&quot;同一物业内不引入竞品柜点&quot;，这是防止自食与被竞品夹击最有效的条款；对业主而言通常是零成本的让步。</li>\n<li><strong>租金结构与调整</strong>：固定租金 vs 阶梯分成 vs 保底分成（min guarantee）。谈判要点是把保底压到接近盈亏平衡点，把上行留给分成。</li>\n<li><strong>安装与复原责任</strong>：谁负责硬化地基、电缆、防雨棚；退出时柜体拆除与地面复原由谁承担、费用上限多少。这一条在退租时常常是最大的隐性成本。</li>\n<li><strong>保险与责任</strong>：柜体财产险、因柜体引发的第三方人身/财产责任归属；占用公共区域时的许可维持责任。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>可行性评估的最后一步是<strong>单点财务模型</strong>：把租金、电费、网络费、运维、柜体折旧、预计吞吐与单件毛利放进一张表，算出<strong>回收周期</strong>与<strong>盈亏平衡日均件量</strong>。粗略的经验阈值是回收周期超过 4–5 年、或盈亏平衡件量高于现场测算件量 30% 以上的点位，通常不进第一批。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[候选点通过覆盖与互食筛选] --&gt; B[实地勘址 硬约束核查]&#10;    B --&gt;|任一项不满足| Z[否决 记录原因]&#10;    B --&gt;|全部满足| C[清点竞品与自家点 估分流]&#10;    C --&gt; D[业主接触 探合作模式]&#10;    D --&gt; E[租约条款谈判 排他/退出/复原]&#10;    E --&gt; F[单点财务模型 回收周期]&#10;    F --&gt;|回收 &lt;= 4-5 年| G[进入实施排期]&#10;    F --&gt;|回收过长| H[回谈租金或降级]&#10;    H --&gt; E\">graph TD\n    A[候选点通过覆盖与互食筛选] --&gt; B[实地勘址 硬约束核查]\n    B --&gt;|任一项不满足| Z[否决 记录原因]\n    B --&gt;|全部满足| C[清点竞品与自家点 估分流]\n    C --&gt; D[业主接触 探合作模式]\n    D --&gt; E[租约条款谈判 排他/退出/复原]\n    E --&gt; F[单点财务模型 回收周期]\n    F --&gt;|回收 &lt;= 4-5 年| G[进入实施排期]\n    F --&gt;|回收过长| H[回谈租金或降级]\n    H --&gt; E</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>覆盖盲区有三类：几何（分散低密）、屏障（路网割裂）、属性（人口有但不使用）。前两类靠路网距离矩阵和过街点核查解决，第三类靠需求转化率而非人口数判断。</li>\n<li>互食用互食率 CR 度量，$<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>CR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mtext>old</mtext><mtext>before</mtext></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mtext>old</mtext><mtext>after</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CR} = (Q_{\\text{old}}^{\\text{before}} - Q_{\\text{old}}^{\\text{after}})/Q_{\\text{new}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1322em;vertical-align:-0.2831em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4169em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">old</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">before</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1322em;vertical-align:-0.2831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4169em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">old</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">after</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>，健康扩张应压在</mtext><mn>0.3</mn><mtext>以下；纯转移型重叠应改为挪点而非加点。距离衰减（</mtext><mi>H</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mtext>型分流）是把互食写进模型的标准工具，</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">，健康扩张应压在 0.3 以下；纯转移型重叠应改为挪点而非加点。距离衰减（Huff 型分流）是把互食写进模型的标准工具，</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">，健康扩张应压在</span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">以下；纯转移型重叠应改为挪点而非加点。距离衰减（</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">型分流）是把互食写进模型的标准工具，</span></span></span></span></span>\\beta$ 必须本地拟合。</li>\n<li>勘址是把&quot;位置好&quot;降级成可核验事实的过程：电源、网络、用地消防、无障碍是硬约束，人流业态与业主分成是软约束。</li>\n<li>租约里真正值钱的不是低租金，而是排他性、中期退出权和复原责任上限——它们决定了网络能不能随需求迁移。</li>\n<li>最后用回收周期与盈亏平衡件量做 go/no-go，阈值以上的点位宁可回谈也不进第一批。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"覆盖盲区、柜点互食与现场验证：勘址、租约谈判与落地可行性","id":"覆盖盲区-柜点互食与现场验证-勘址-租约谈判与落地可行性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"覆盖盲区的识别：模型看不见的三种地方","id":"覆盖盲区的识别-模型看不见的三种地方"},{"level":2,"text":"柜点互食的度量与容忍阈值","id":"柜点互食的度量与容忍阈值"},{"level":2,"text":"勘址清单：把\"位置好\"变成可核验的事实","id":"勘址清单-把-位置好-变成可核验的事实"},{"level":2,"text":"租约谈判与落地可行性","id":"租约谈判与落地可行性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"候选点位评分与排序：POI 客流、场地租金、电力网络与业主意愿","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/parcel-locker-network-site-planning-optimization/site-selection-coverage-optimization/site-scoring-candidate-ranking"},"next":{"title":"柜格容量测算模型：格口尺寸组合、周转率与包裹停留时长分布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/parcel-locker-network-site-planning-optimization/capacity-configuration-network/locker-capacity-dimensioning-model"}}